             72  * ABSTRACT:
             73  *
             74  *       ASC RETURNS THE DECIMAL INTEGER VALUE
             75  *       OF THE FIRST BYTE OF THE ARGUMENT.
             76  *
             77  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
             78  *
             79  *       B @ASCF
             80  *
             81  *       IN  (R2) = ADDRESS
             82  *       OUT (R2) = RESULT
             83  *       EXIT TO EVSFR$
             84  *
             85  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:  (NONE)
             86  *
             87  * EXTERNAL ROUTINES:
             88  *
             89  *       REF MEMF1       ;USE MEMF EXIT
             90  *
             91  * LOCAL DATA:  (NONE)
             92  *
             93  * ENTRY POINT:
             94  *
             95          DEF ASCF
             96  *
     002E'   97  ASCF   EQU  $
002E D052    98         MOVB *R2,R1
0030 10F8    99         JMP  MEMF1
            100          END
